      "content": "While it feels logical in your pain, the belief that your existence diminishes their sacrifice is a distorted perspective that often stems from deep shame rather than reality. Many people you know who come from humble or broken households have built magnificent legacies simply by accessing the very opportunities your parents fought so hard for you to climb. Your value is intrinsic and cannot be measured by your mistakes, and carrying this weight without support can silently lead you down a dangerous path. Please consider reaching out to a counselor or a trusted mental health professional who can help you untangle these thoughts and find a way forward. You deserve to live with clarity and compassion, not because you've earned it, but simply because you matter.",
